"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show][color=ffb64d]现在[colorEnd]这个自卫团，是在山里的异变发生之后，由[color=ffb64d]大姐头[colorEnd]独自拉起来的队伍——不过村里人都以为皮塔和卡夫是我们的首领，并不知道真正的头头是谁。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊，这个我懂。是为了对罗伯特大叔保密是吧？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]嗯，毕竟大姐头的家庭关系……比较复杂。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"我还有一个问题……","tag":"tag_12"},{"text":"外来者为什么会受到敌视？","tag":"tag_12"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[cm][show]这就更简单了。你看那边——[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"y\": -20.3,\r    \"time\": 1,\r    \"zoom\": 1,\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"x\": -2.08\r  },\r  \"action\": \"cameraMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"time":1300,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"愤怒的村民","text":"[show]喂，这和说好的不一样，不是说一斗只要30阿比的吗！现在怎么要50了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"武装行商","text":"[show]面粉的价就是这样，没有为什么！爱要不要，不要就滚滚滚滚滚——[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"武装行商","text":"[show]我把粮食运到山里，是在救你们的命，为了报答我这个救命恩人，你不应该多出点钱犒劳一下我们吗！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"愤怒的村民","text":"[show]你——！[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"heroType\": 1,\r    \"npc\": \"\"\r  },\r  \"action\": \"cameraTarget\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"time":1300,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]就像你看到的那样，会来这片穷山恶水的外来者，多半都是这种货色。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]这些家伙号称是商人，实际上都是[color=f1401c]全副武装的佣兵[colorEnd]，一直以贩卖粮食的名义赖在村子里，每天都会和村里人发生冲突。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]工头他好几次想要驱逐那些嚣张的家伙……但一来他们确实带来了一些粮食，二来，也不知道他们给村里人灌了什么迷魂汤，一些矿工坚决反对这么做，最后只能不了了之。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]总之现在村子的状况，所有人都很不满意。但因为种种原因，大家都忍了下来。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“双刃”费萨","text":"[show]我总觉得这么忍下去，迟早要出事。希望在真的出事之前，大姐头能够打倒恐怖蟾兽，让村子能够回到从前的样子吧。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"非常感谢您。","tag":"tag_29"},{"text":"米托拉，我们继续问问别人吧。","tag":"tag_29"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]嗯！[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"mov